      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُؤُوبَةٌ</span></b>  (K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جُؤْبَةٌ</span></b>  (K accord. to some copies,
